  "releaseNotes": "Jobs and automations return Reservation instead of Passport (still accepted on input). Automation updates clear Tokens and Reservation left out of the body. 400 for an unreadable automation or unknown job status; 409 for a Trigger Now the Job Automator would drop or a job delete whose status differs. Requires Automations 17.5.0: JobCompletedTrigger, also in GET api/automations/triggers, takes AutomationName instead of RepositoryType, ConnectionString and TaskId. Jobs that miss their heartbeat are now TimedOut, not Error, so the health error ratio skips them.",
